.vercel
# Contents rather than the directory itself — git won't descend into an
# excluded directory, so `images/` would make the negation below a no-op.
images/*
# Player cover art is small, versioned WebP the front page depends on.
!images/audio/
scripts/pg_catalog.csv
.DS_Store

# macOS Finder custom-icon file. The name ends in a carriage return,
# and git strips one trailing CR from a pattern, so this needs two.
# Straight from GitHub Global/macOS.gitignore.
Icon
